log1p(input, *, out=None) -> Tensor

Returns a new tensor with the natural logarithm of (1 + :attr:`input`).

.. math::
    y_i = \log_{e} (x_i + 1)

.. note:: This function is more accurate than :func:`torch.log` for small
          values of :attr:`input`

